Uh, thank you guys for inviting me. Um,
I want to be clear about the scope of

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:12.880 align:start position:19%
this talk. I'm not here to prescribe an
entire technical architecture or write a

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:17.120 align:start position:19%
